# Raw daily logs (gitignored after week 1)
_docs/log/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].md
_docs/log/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-human.md
_docs/log/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].md.gz

# Track summaries and audits
!_docs/log/weekly-*.md
!_docs/log/*/summary.md
!_docs/log/failure-audit*.md
!_docs/log/index.md
!_docs/log/archive/**

# Runtime state (never commit)
_docs/cache/
_docs/state/orchestrator.lock
_docs/state/heartbeat.txt
_docs/state/PAUSE
_docs/state/RESTART
_docs/state/RESET
_docs/state/RESET_APPROVED
_docs/state/RESET_IDS
_docs/state/RESET_PLATFORM_APPROVED
_docs/state/initialized
_docs/state/compressed/
_docs/state/outputs/orphan-*/
_docs/state/recovery.log
_docs/state/log-rotating
_docs/state/CANCEL_*

